            "reviewBody": "This was very yummy and easy to make! Looking at the recipe though we felt it needed a little extra something so made a quick 'salad' of shredded lettuce, chopped pickle and chopped tomato tossed lightly with mayo and served it on top. It was AWESOME! So quick, so easy and my family all agreed they would like it again!!",
