              "name": "Kristen B"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These turned out really good! Super easy and fast to make which would be great for a weeknight meal. Two out of my three kids were reluctant at first, but they all ended up liking the sandwiches. I did add chopped pickles to the ground beef at the end because a restaurant in town adds pickles to sandwiches like this, and they just make it that much better! I will make these again soon, thanks for the recipe!",
